<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL TO LIST 0.3 MLN MORE SHRS AUG 4.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL TO LIST 0.3 MLN MORE SHRS AUG 4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse will add 260,000 common shares in Polish poultry producer Indykpol SA to the 970,000 already listed on August 4, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The 260,000 shares were previously registered shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
